---
permalink: /en/about/
title: About
trUrl: /tr/hakkimda/
enUrl: /en/about/
---
{% set s = strings[lang] %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h1>{{ s.about.title }}</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="about-bio">
      <p>Since graduating from Marmara University with a degree in Statistics, I have worked in data analytics, reporting, data engineering and visualization across a wide range of projects. Today I provide end-to-end consultancy on integrating SAP and non-SAP systems with BusinessObjects, Power BI and SAP Analytics Cloud.</p>

      <p>From 2021 onwards I worked as a Data/BI Analyst at Logitrans, Hasçelik and Anatolia Tile. Since 2024 I work as an independent consultant under IBSS, serving organizations across Türkiye and Europe.</p>

      <p>Core stack: <strong>SAP BW, SAP BO, SAP Datasphere, SAP HANA, SAP Data Services, SAP Analytics Cloud, MSSQL Server, Snowflake, Microsoft Fabric, Power BI and Tableau.</strong></p>

      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a href="{{ site.cvFile }}" class="btn btn-primary" download>{{ s.cta.downloadCv }}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>{{ s.about.experienceTitle }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      {% for item in experience %}
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-period">{{ item.period.en }}</div>
        <div class="timeline-role">
          <h4>{{ item.role.en }}</h4>
          <span class="company">{{ item.company }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>{{ s.about.certsTitle }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cert-grid">
      {% for cert in certifications %}
      <div class="cert-item">
        <div class="cert-name">{{ cert.name }}</div>
        <div class="cert-meta">{{ cert.issuer }} · {{ cert.year }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>{{ s.about.educationTitle }}</h2>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">{{ s.about.education }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
